<https://w3id.org/gelmat/usesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process (creation/synthesis step or sample preparation step such as solvent exchange or drying) to chemical substances used as reactants, catalysts, solvents, or exchange media"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/usesSubstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "usesSubstance"@en .
