<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasID> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Identifier (ID) is one or more characters used to identify, name, or characterize the nature, properties, or contents of a thing.\r\n(http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C25364)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has ID"@en .
