_:genid35 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid38 .
_:genid38 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid37 .
_:genid37 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid36 .
_:genid36 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
