<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasOrderNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/polymat/ExperimentRequestSubmission> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasOrderNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasOrderNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An order number is a reference number assigned to an experiment when it is submitted for processing."@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasOrderNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has order number"@en .
