<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasProductID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A product ID is a permanent, unique identifier assigned to a product by its producer.\r\n(https://ode.rsl.wustl.edu/mars/pagehelp/Content/Frequently_Asked_Questions/Product_ID.htm?Highlight=Product%20ID)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasProductID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has product ID"@en .
