<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasRequestSubmissionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A request submission type is an experiment submission type description, e.g. synthesis, fabrication, analysis."@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/hasRequestSubmissionType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has request submission type"@en .
