<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Acid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Acid"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Acid> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A chemical entity capable of donating a proton (Bronsted acid) or accepting an electron pair (Lewis acid)"@en .
# 
