<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Ambigel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A dried gel obtained by ambient pressure (evaporative) drying under conditions that largely preserve the pore network (surface modification, low-surface-tension solvent); intermediate between xerogel and aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Ambigel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ambigel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Ambigel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dried gel produced by ambient pressure drying with measures that substantially preserve the mesoporous network"@en .
