<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BETAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Brunauer-Emmett-Teller analysis for determining specific surface area from gas adsorption isotherms"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BETAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BET analysis"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BETAnalysis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A porosity measurement in which specific surface area is determined from a gas adsorption isotherm using the Brunauer-Emmett-Teller model"@en .
