<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BioAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/PolymerAerogel> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BioAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An aerogel derived from biological materials such as cellulose, chitosan, alginate, or proteins"@en .
