<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BiopolymerPrecursor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Precursor> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BiopolymerPrecursor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A natural polymer (polysaccharide or protein) that forms a bio-aerogel network by physical or ionic gelation: cellulose, nanocellulose, chitosan, alginate, pectin, gelatin, starch"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BiopolymerPrecursor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Biopolymer precursor"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BiopolymerPrecursor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A natural polymer used as the network-forming precursor of a bio-aerogel"@en .
