# https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Density> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The mass of a porous body divided by its envelope (geometric) volume, including the pore space. The most commonly reported density of aerogels, typically 1-500 kg/m3 (0.001-0.5 g/cm3) for silica aerogels; determined geometrically or by envelope (powder displacement) pycnometry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bulk density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Apparent density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Envelope density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The density of a porous material computed over its envelope volume, i.e. including both the solid skeleton and the gas-filled pore space"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensity> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasCanonicalUnit> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/kilogramPerCubicmetre> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Analysis> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Determination of bulk (envelope) density (gmat:BulkDensity), usually geometrically from mass and dimensions of a regular monolith, or by envelope (powder displacement) pycnometry (e.g. GeoPyc)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bulk density measurement"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Envelope density measurement"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/BulkDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that determines the envelope density of a sample from its mass and envelope volume"@en .
