<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CelluloseFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CelluloseFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cellulosic fibres (pulp, cotton, regenerated cellulose) used as bio-based reinforcement in aerogel composites"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CelluloseFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cellulose fibre"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CelluloseFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cellulose fiber"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CelluloseFibre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A cellulosic fibre used as bio-based reinforcement in aerogel composites"@en .
