# https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/PolymerSynthesis> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reaction in which the growth of a polymer chain proceeds exclusively by reaction between a monomer and the reactive site on the polymer chain with regeneration of the reactive site at the end of each growth step\r\n(http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MOP_0000634)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chain growth polymerisation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ChainGrowthPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A polymer synthesis in which chain growth proceeds exclusively by reaction between monomer and a reactive site on the growing chain, with regeneration of the reactive site at each step"@en .
