# https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/Quantity> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The coefficient of determination (R²) of a regression fit, quantifying the goodness of fit of a model to experimental data (e.g. an Arrhenius fit of gelation kinetics). Dimensionless, 0-1"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Coefficient of determination"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "R-squared"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "R²"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dimensionless statistical quantity (0 ≤ R² ≤ 1) expressing the proportion of variance in observed data explained by a fitted model"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoefficientOfDetermination> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasCanonicalUnit> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/one> .
