<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompositeAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Composite aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompositeAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An aerogel containing reinforcing materials or fillers embedded within the aerogel matrix"@en .
