# https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Analysis> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Measurement of mechanical strength and stress-strain behavior under compressive loads"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compression testing"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CompressionTesting> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that measures the stress-strain behaviour and strength of a material under compressive load"@en .
