<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Cooling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Controlled reduction of temperature after a thermal step or to induce thermal gelation (e.g. gelatin); the descending counterpart of temperature ramping"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Cooling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cooling"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Cooling> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sample preparation step in which the temperature of a sample is lowered in a controlled manner"@en .
