<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoolingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Equipment> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CoolingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Equipment for controlled cooling during processing"@en .
