# https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Method> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action of bringing something into existence"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Creation process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <http://emmo.info/emmo#EMMO_43e99ae1> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/Process> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/CreationProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A method by which a material entity is brought into existence, comprising the constituent steps of a synthesis workflow"@en .
