# https://w3id.org/gelmat/DeionizedWater
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/DeionizedWater> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/DeionizedWater> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Water> .
