<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Depressurization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Controlled reduction of pressure during supercritical drying to return to ambient conditions, performed slowly to avoid re-condensation of supercritical fluid"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Depressurization> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Depressurization"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Depressurization> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sample preparation step in which pressure is reduced in a controlled manner, in supercritical drying performed slowly to avoid re-condensation of the fluid"@en .
