<https://w3id.org/gelmat/DryingControlAdditiveRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Drying control additive role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/DryingControlAdditiveRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role borne by a substance that moderates evaporation and capillary stress during drying of a gel"@en .
