<https://w3id.org/gelmat/FractalDimension> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A dimensionless exponent describing the self-similar (power-law) scaling of an aerogel network with length scale, determined from small-angle scattering (SAXS/SANS). General parent for the mass fractal dimension (Dm, network mass scaling) and the surface fractal dimension (Ds, interface roughness scaling)"@en .
