<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Gelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The sol-gel transition process where a liquid colloidal solution transforms into a solid gel network through hydrolysis and condensation reactions"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Gelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gelation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Gelation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The sol-gel process stage in which condensation reactions cause the growing network to span the entire reaction volume, producing a solid gel at the gel point (SolGelTransition); the sol irreversibly loses fluidity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Gelation> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasStepOrder> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
