_:genid71 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Water> .
_:genid71 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/usesSubstance> .
_:genid71 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Hydrolysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reaction of a silicon alkoxide precursor with water to generate silanol groups (Si-OH). Rate depends on pH, water-to-alkoxide ratio, and solvent. Acid catalysis accelerates hydrolysis; base catalysis promotes condensation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Hydrolysis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hydrolysis"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Hydrolysis> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Nucleophilic substitution of alkoxy groups by hydroxyl groups in the presence of water, yielding silanols as sol-gel intermediates"@en .
