<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Impregnation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/SamplePreparation> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Impregnation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Infiltrating a porous host (fibre mat, foam) with a sol, or a finished aerogel with a functional phase; the standard route to aerogel blankets and composites (see also pmat:Coating)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Impregnation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impregnation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Impregnation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Infiltration"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Impregnation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sample preparation step in which a liquid phase is infiltrated into a porous host material"@en .
