<https://w3id.org/gelmat/IncompleteDrying> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The defect state of residual solvent or moisture remaining in the aerogel pores after the drying step. Denotes the persisting residual-liquid feature of the material, not the (incomplete) drying process itself."@en .
