<https://w3id.org/gelmat/IncompleteDrying> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Incomplete drying"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/IncompleteDrying> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An aerogel defect consisting of residual solvent or moisture remaining in the pore network of the material after drying"@en .
