<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Macroporosity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Presence of unintended macropores (> 50 nm) in the aerogel network, causing loss of mesoporosity, reduced surface area, and lower thermal insulation performance. Arises from phase separation or syneresis during gelation"@en .
