<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Macroporosity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An aerogel defect characterised by the presence of unintended pores larger than 50 nm in the otherwise mesoporous network, caused by phase separation or syneresis during gelation, leading to reduced surface area and impaired insulation performance"@en .
