<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ModulePerformance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Module performance"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ModulePerformance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that assesses the throughput and selectivity of a separation module"@en .
