<https://w3id.org/gelmat/MolarRatio> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ratio of moles between two or more substances in a reaction or mixture. Used to describe stoichiometric proportions of reagents (e.g., H2O/MTMS = 59.75)."@en .
