<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosilicaAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organosilica aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosilicaAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Hybrid silica aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosilicaAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Methylsilica aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosilicaAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A hybrid aerogel in which organic functional groups are incorporated into the inorganic silica backbone via covalent Si–C bonds"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosiliconCompound
