<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosiliconCompound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosiliconCompound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Any compound containing silicon–carbon bonds; includes silanes, siloxanes, and silicon alkoxides used as precursors in sol–gel chemistry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosiliconCompound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organosilicon Compound"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganosiliconCompound> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A chemical compound containing at least one silicon-carbon bond"@en .
