<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OverheadStirrer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Instrument> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OverheadStirrer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mechanical stirring equipment mounted above container for mixing viscous solutions or gels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OverheadStirrer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Overhead stirrer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/OverheadStirrer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An instrument with a motor-driven impeller mounted above the vessel, used for mixing viscous solutions or gels"@en .
