<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ParticleSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The diameter or dimension of the primary particles making up the aerogel framework"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ParticleSize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Particle size"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ParticleSize> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A quantity representing the characteristic dimension of the primary particles composing a material framework"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ParticleSize> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasCanonicalUnit> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/metre> .
