<https://w3id.org/gelmat/PhaseSeparation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A gelation mechanism driven by the separation of phases within the sol"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/PhaseSeparation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Phase separation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/PhaseSeparation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A gelation pathway in which network formation is driven by separation of the sol into distinct phases"@en .
