<https://w3id.org/gelmat/PhenolicAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/OrganicAerogel> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/PhenolicAerogel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An organic aerogel derived from phenolic resin precursors"@en .
