<https://w3id.org/gelmat/RawData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Original, unprocessed data collected directly from experiment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/RawData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Raw data"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/RawData> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Original, unprocessed data collected directly from an experiment"@en .
