# https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Substance> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A material embedded in an aerogel matrix as a reinforcing or functional filler phase - fibres, nanocarbons, clays. Linked from a gmat:CompositeAerogel with gmat:hasReinforcement; the function in a synthesis step is stated with prov:hadRole some gmat:ReinforcementRole"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reinforcement"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Reinforcement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A substance incorporated into a composite aerogel as reinforcing or functional filler phase"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Role> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The role of a substance embedded as a reinforcing or filler phase in a composite (e.g. glass fibre, cellulose fibre, graphene oxide, carbon nanotubes)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reinforcement role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/ReinforcementRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role borne by a substance incorporated into a composite to improve its mechanical or functional properties"@en .
