<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Sintering> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "High-temperature densification of a porous network by viscous flow or diffusion below the melting point; used deliberately for densification or as an unwanted effect limiting the service temperature of aerogels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Sintering> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sintering"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Sintering> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A thermal treatment that densifies a porous solid by particle coalescence below the melting point"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/Density> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The mass of a porous body divided by the volume of its solid skeleton only, excluding open pore space; determined by helium pycnometry (gmat:SkeletalDensityMeasurement). Typically 1800-2200 kg/m3 (1.8-2.2 g/cm3) for silica aerogels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Skeletal density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "True density"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The density of the solid skeleton of a porous material, computed over the skeletal volume that excludes open pores; measured by gas displacement (helium) pycnometry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensity> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasCanonicalUnit> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/kilogramPerCubicmetre> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Analysis> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Measurement of true density of solid material in aerogel, typically using helium pycnometry"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Skeletal density measurement"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SkeletalDensityMeasurement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An analysis that determines the density of the solid skeleton of a porous material, typically by helium pycnometry"@en .
