# https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/AmountOfSubstanceConcentration> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The molar or mass concentration of the precursor monomer in the sol (mol/L or wt%). Controls the density and pore volume of the final aerogel"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sol concentration"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The molar or mass concentration of the precursor monomer in the starting sol, governing the density of the resulting aerogel; higher concentrations yield denser, stronger, less porous aerogels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolConcentration> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasCanonicalUnit> <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/molePerCubicmetre> .
# 
