_:genid74 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolventExchange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Process of systematically replacing pore liquid in wet gel structures (hydrogels or alcogels) with a more volatile or supercritical-compatible solvent through multiple washing cycles"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolventExchange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Solvent exchange"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolventExchange> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A sample preparation step in which the pore liquid of a wet gel is progressively replaced by a target solvent (e.g. ethanol, acetone, or liquid CO2) to remove water and residual reactants before drying"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SolventExchange> <https://w3id.org/gelmat/hasStepOrder> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#positiveInteger> .
