<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SpecificHeatCapacity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The amount of heat energy required to raise the temperature of a unit mass of material by one degree, typically expressed in J/(kg*K). Relevant for aerogel thermal energy storage applications"@en .
