# https://w3id.org/polymat/MolarPermeability-Diffusion
<https://w3id.org/polymat/MolarPermeability-Diffusion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/MolarPermeability-Diffusion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/polymat/Permeability-Diffusion> .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/MolarPermeability-Diffusion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The permeability multiplied by density and divided by molar mass of the permeating fluid\r\n\r\nP* = V･d･rho / (A･t･p･M) = D･rho / (p･M)\r\n\r\nP* = molar permeability (diffusion)\r\nV = Volume of the permeate [m³]\r\nrho = density of the permeate [kg/m³]\r\nM = molar mass of the permeate [kg/mol]\r\nd = thickness of the membrane [m]\r\nA = area of the membrane [m²]\r\nt = time of diffusion [s]\r\np = pressure difference [atm]\r\nD = Diffusion coefficient = diffusivity [m²/s]\r\n\r\nThe SI unit is mol/(m･s･atm)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/MolarPermeability-Diffusion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Molar permeability (diffusion)"@en .
