<https://w3id.org/polymat/RAFTPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type of living polymerisation involving a conventional radical polymerisation which is mediated by a RAFT agent (a thiocarbonylthio compound); this affords control over the generated molecular weight and polydispersity\r\n(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reversible_addition%E2%88%92fragmentation_chain-transfer_polymerization)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/RAFTPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reversible addition-fragmentation chain-transfer polymerisation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/polymat/RAFTPolymerisation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "RAFT polymerisation"@en .
