<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SupercriticalCO2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Carbon dioxide in the supercritical state, used as a low-surface-tension drying medium in supercritical drying of gels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/SupercriticalCO2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_16526> .
