<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Tannin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Condensed or hydrolysable plant tannins, bio-based polyphenols used with formaldehyde or furfural as low-cost precursors of tannin-based organic and carbon aerogels"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Tannin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tannin"@en .
<https://w3id.org/gelmat/Tannin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plant-derived polyphenol used as a bio-based phenolic precursor in organic aerogel syntheses"@en .
